{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "d80222c536ec6a686ec35021ecfaa483a2410400d780275a73022a44127eca6a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nちょうどいいとこに……お願いがあるんです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你来得正好……我有事拜托你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "725219df855888ae9810dfe6bb2053d3b6f4c0502441d35bb5ea8b8f44008562", "ja": "明日、お休みもらえませんか？\n1日だけでいいんで！", "zh": "我明天可以休假吗？\n只要一天就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e3726a0f147fab97f625afd6bbf55d49d98200bd5ec7c5539e011c1f568e3514", "ja": "明日って、ずいぶん急な話だな。\n何か急用でもあるのか？", "zh": "今天请明天的假，还真是突然啊。\n你有什么急事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "7f3e3f9c764cfce747fb3037395cce0a8a50e8efb6a3ec42a56ad3f0748004ab", "ja": "はい！\nあ、でもそんな急用でもないんですけど……。", "zh": "嘿对！\n啊，但也不算是很急啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e58077eb2e733a832b405cb7203d50e636e2d226cd7ed8111428f2c66044ce1", "ja": "この衣装、めっ……ちゃカワイイから、\n大阪の家族や友達にも見てもらいたいなぁって。", "zh": "这套服装超──级可爱的啦，\n我就想让大阪的家人跟朋友也看一看咩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3136aa31c72a7c3527642d5183ddd25d794118fc13447f0ce2e1a2a2a4a302ff", "ja": "見てもらいたいって……奈緒、まさか。", "zh": "想让他们看一看……奈绪，你该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "a4de189081836638a3f7a3f7c44c4bb6acbbb65cbd05fc39859a27786a9470ba", "ja": "はい！　大阪まで、ひとっ走りしてこようかなって♪\n{$P$}さん、知ってました？", "zh": "没错！我打算跑一趟大阪啦♪\n{$P$}先生，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "3bcb642adb9822ccc4369c6054b5ce62f305a37a441a83cd5f6796ae204a2b3a", "ja": "新幹線に乗れば、なんと大阪まで、3時間もあれば\n着いてまうんですよ！　いや～あっという間やわ～。", "zh": "如果搭新干线，只要花三小时就能到大阪喔！\n哎呀～真的是一眨眼就到了吼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_1008", "source_sha256": "7006e66074cf1f5ce49a706d871d026631c88302c6ecae337a08d8f1f902889c", "ja": "知ってました", "zh": "我知道", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d2e5a25cef57d1e3f14c05b23f58776e5730cce400b8c8c0bc70d27c08c8de16", "ja": "いや、それは知ってたけど……衣装を見せるためだけに\n実家まで帰るのは、交通費がもったいなくないか？", "zh": "不是，这我是知道……但只是为了让他们看这套\n服装就回去老家，不觉得太浪费交通费了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "b8091233fddbe112902544d57e1fd25adb1e2529db3b1837273d4beb32f09fee", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さんは！\n乙女心がわからんようなこと言わんといてくださいよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你真的是吼！\n请别说这种不懂少女心的话啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1c6869b97227eea8c61045764a319915d745ad1a354440dc0fbc42fa808ea3d2", "ja": "えっ、あっ、はい。すみません……。", "zh": "咦？啊，你说得是，真抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2003_037nao", "source_sha256": "4b46b86be7e5fbbd289d91b7b3d4ddd72b4ca063dddaa4e11057e4031efa05d5", "ja": "カワイイ衣装見せて、「いや～奈緒ちゃんホンマに\n可愛らしいな、本物のグレーテルみたいやわぁ」とか。", "zh": "我就是想要给他们看可爱的服装，听他们说\n「哇～奈绪真的好可爱，好像真正的葛丽特啊」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "b7d49771d284a3e8d33931c907fb75375e12f08afbe7d2a8bb7c9bab4ea35303", "ja": "「グレーテルなら、お菓子がいるやんな！\n飴ちゃんでええか？」とか、言われたいやないですか！", "zh": "或是「既然你是葛丽特，就要给你点心吼！\n糖果可以吗？」之类的话咩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2005_p", "source_sha256": "9587086ee60432bf4a67d04cd3906952354ebf6a12642704d4ca0301defc4579", "ja": "そ、そうか……というか、本物のグレーテルって\nどんなだかわからないけど……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n是说我也不知道真正的葛丽特是怎么样啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2006_p", "source_sha256": "8e1366700f769da60b2d4249658ced915b56dae9c440f4de689182b5ef1229fc", "ja": "でも、目的が衣装を見せるだけなら、\nわざわざ帰らなくても大丈夫だと思うけど。", "zh": "不过，如果目的只是想给他们看服装，\n我想应该不用特地回去一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2007_037nao", "source_sha256": "a28b3755f45d94892fe7a3e0710e588c820e85e35fe002f1ef3ba15738dbe90f", "ja": "へっ？　なんでですか？", "zh": "咦？为什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2008_p", "source_sha256": "214567d0655337549918c9a4ca75fd13c42ca3f68b715c70f1e92cf0ffd5b627", "ja": "なんでって……衣装の写真、ブログに載せただろ？\n家族や友達に見てもらえばいいじゃないか。", "zh": "还问为什么……服装的照片不是放在部落格上了吗？\n你只要叫家人跟朋友去看部落格就好了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2009_037nao", "source_sha256": "5ff49924a6e18c746da66142f7a3fd9907a7e647dd207c1fd62df94534cc2883", "ja": "あっ……せやった！　わざわざこの衣装で、\n新幹線乗らんでも良かったんや！", "zh": "啊……对吼！\n不用特地穿这套服装去搭新干线啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2010_p", "source_sha256": "6fd688f0a667c0f4abc792f47e912ee0c1a6027df52cd87a6fed706ab25d80bc", "ja": "衣装のまま新幹線に乗るつもりだったのか……。", "zh": "你本来想直接穿这套服装去搭新干线吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2011_037nao", "source_sha256": "8fb7eecb3dae2828477d441ca0d028be13e60b8f21714b95eb68f730875c347f", "ja": "飴ちゃんもらわれへんのは残念ですけど、\nそれは今度帰った時でええもんな♪", "zh": "虽然不能收到糖果很可惜，\n但下次回去时再跟他们要就好啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2012_037nao", "source_sha256": "0b7b7c15f9e7715b82c501f42794c385159bb8ed552e9ddbc5f739122a88d882", "ja": "さっそく、ブログのことみんなに教えよーっと。\n……あれ？　あれれ？", "zh": "那我马上来通知大家去看部落格嘿。\n……咦？奇怪了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2013_p", "source_sha256": "2dd260d0b8cb4f571465350c66a5a4fb61d4c057c2917cbe8b1d0c5ab94d49e6", "ja": "今度はどうした？", "zh": "又怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2014_037nao", "source_sha256": "9c9b5d4f26b5813ff5c93dde17d977bb5427a299af393a16660e3ab78707355d", "ja": "いや、えっと……私の携帯、家族や友達から、\nメールやらメッセージがいっぱい来てました……。", "zh": "没有啦，呃……\n我的手机收到好多亲友传来的简讯跟讯息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2015_037nao", "source_sha256": "4b3a78fc23e9f8604adb30093d7a38e81bba2bcdb5727691c729bdb3204a1c11", "ja": "みんな、もうブログ見てくれたんや。\n……あかん、めっちゃうれしい……。", "zh": "大家都已经看过部落格啦。\n……不妙，我超开心的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2016_p", "source_sha256": "7e11a49712e6996c1bcf2a87f547412aa970dab558caa7e3dde107dc1e1ed25e", "ja": "普段から、みんな応援してくれてるって事だな。\n良かったな、奈緒。", "zh": "也就是说大家平常就一直在替你加油呢。\n太好了，奈绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2017_037nao", "source_sha256": "923ed4f7e5d706ab79294c57af86e727ee70bec09f8a155386c0eac3841481df", "ja": "えへへ……はい！\n私、メッチャやる気わいてきました！", "zh": "嘿嘿……是啊！\n我突然充满干劲啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0114_2018_037nao", "source_sha256": "f12220afa8362c525945d0b023f2fea9085ab67cfb03e49d107341582090a7f9", "ja": "よっしゃ、今日も張り切っていっくでー！\nプロデューサーさん、お仕事たくさんお願いしますね！", "zh": "好，今天也要全力以赴啦──！\n制作人先生，麻烦你替我接很多工作啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
